  "previewIconUrl": "https://resources.gdevelop-app.com/assets/Icons/Line Hero Pack/Master/SVG/Videogames/Videogames_controller_joystick_arrows_direction.svg",
  "shortDescription": "A steering wheel and pedals for touchscreens, for racing and driving games.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": [
    "Turn a sprite into a steering wheel or a pedal for touchscreens:",
    "- The **steering wheel** turns with a touch and moves a stick of a multitouch controller to the left or to the right.",
    "- The **gas pedal** pushes a stick up, and the **brake pedal** pushes it down.",
    "",
    "They work like the multitouch joysticks: add a \"multitouch mapper\" behavior to the vehicle (for example the 3D car mapper, which steers with the primary stick and accelerates with the secondary stick) and it is driven without any event.",
    "The value of the wheel can also be read with an expression, to move a vehicle with events.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use steering wheels and pedals in many styles are in the asset store [multitouch joysticks pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=multitouch-joysticks-multitouch-joysticks)."
  ],
  "origin": {
    "identifier": "MultitouchDrivingControls",
    "name": "gdevelop-extension-store"
  },
